// Port of metal-rs; Copyright 2016 GFX developers and metal-rs contributors.

// Unsafe raw Metal API. Objects must be live, correctly typed, and supported on the running OS.
// Object getters are borrowed (+0); new/serialized objects are owned (+1), released by the caller.
// String inputs must be non-null NUL-terminated UTF-8; outputs borrow their NSString storage.
// Buffer and texture byte pointers must cover all accessed bytes; caller synchronizes GPU/CPU access.
// C-layout record inputs and results cross the native boundary by value.
